PROVE: directed energy GA vs RANDOM search at matched evals (4824), grouped mutation, width=1.0
local K=3 generative filter, 50 seeds, mean +/- SD. compact = taps->K(=3), contig->1, on-rel->1

  N   arm     taps           contig         on-rel         test
  12  GA      3.4±2.6      0.73±0.31     0.61±0.40     0.885±0.028
  12  RANDOM  3.4±3.2      0.71±0.32     0.59±0.41     0.878±0.036
